      ],
      "source": [
        "accuracy = accuracy_score(y_test, y_pred)\n",
        "precision = precision_score(y_test, y_pred)\n",
        "recall = recall_score(y_test, y_pred)\n",
        "f1 = f1_score(y_test, y_pred)\n",
        "auc = roc_auc_score(y_test, probabilidades[:, 1])\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Accuracy:  {accuracy:.4f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Precision: {precision:.4f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Recall:    {recall:.4f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"F1-score:  {f1:.4f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"ROC-AUC:   {auc:.4f}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nMatriz de confusión:\")\n",
        "matriz = confusion_matrix(y_test, y_pred)\n",
        "print(matriz)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nReporte de clasificación:\")\n",
        "print(classification_report(\n",
        "    y_test,\n",
        "    y_pred,\n",
        "    target_names=[\"Benigno\", \"Maligno\"]\n",
        "))\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "981027b4",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Interpretación de las métricas\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Accuracy:** proporción total de predicciones correctas.\n",
        "- **Precision:** de las observaciones clasificadas como malignas, cuántas realmente eran malignas.\n",
        "- **Recall:** de todas las observaciones malignas, cuántas logró identificar el modelo.\n",
        "- **F1-score:** equilibrio entre Precision y Recall.\n",
        "- **Matriz de confusión:** muestra verdaderos negativos, falsos positivos, falsos negativos y verdaderos positivos.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 13,
      "id": "a7c1e6d9",
      "metadata": {},
